  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Busca nos logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Como encontrar um acontecimento\n\n- **Serviço**: filtra a busca global (Monólito, Chat, Front, Keycloak, Infra).\n- **Usuário**: nome (`maria`) ou `sub` do Keycloak. O padrão `.+` mostra só autenticados; use `.*` para incluir anônimos.\n- **Ação**: `RIDE_CREATED`, `MESSAGE_SENT`, `PAYMENT_WEBHOOK` etc.\n- **Status**: `2..` sucesso, `4..` falha, `5..` erro, `4..|5..` ambos.\n- **Busca**: texto livre, rota ou `request_id` (ex.: `req-123`).\n- **Serviço (testes)**: filtra os logs de execução dos testes.\n- **Busca SQL**: filtra a tabela `audit_log` (padrão `%`; use `%termo%`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Busca global em todos os logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=~\"$servico\"} |~ \"$busca\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Monólito · auditoria HTTP (quem fez o quê)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=\"raiji-app\"} |= \"audit_http_request\" | json | event=\"http_request\" | actor_sub=~\"$usuario\" or actor_username=~\"$usuario\" | action=~\"$acao\" | http_status=~\"$status\" |~ \"$busca\" | line_format \"{{.actor_username}} | {{.action}} | {{.http_method}} {{.http_path}} | {{.http_status}} | {{.duration_ms}}ms | {{.request_id}}\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Chat · auditoria HTTP",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=\"raiji-chat\"} |= \"audit_http_request\" | json | audit=\"true\" | actor_sub=~\"$usuario\" or actor_username=~\"$usuario\" | action=~\"$acao\" | http_status=~\"$status\" |~ \"$busca\" | line_format \"{{.actor_username}} | {{.action}} | {{.http_method}} {{.http_path}} | {{.http_status}} | {{.duration_ms}}ms | {{.request_id}}\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Front · navegação e chamadas BFF",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=\"raiji-front\"} |= \"\\\"service\\\":\\\"front-pwa\\\"\" | json | event=~\"http_request|bff_request|page_view\" | actorSub=~\"$usuario\" or actorUsername=~\"$usuario\" |~ \"$busca\" | line_format \"{{.actorUsername}} | {{.event}} | {{.method}} {{.path}} | {{.status}} | {{.requestId}}\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
